Dell C1660w HBPLv1 driver for macOS
===================================

This package contains no code and no file from Dell. It is free software under
the GNU General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any later
version (see LICENSE), and is built from:

- src/rastertohbpl1.c
  From https://github.com/wards999/dell-c1760nw-macos-driver (GPL v2 or later),
  used unchanged. Its HBPLv1 encoder is taken unchanged from foo2hbpl1.c,
  written by Dave Coffin in March 2014, as distributed in
  https://github.com/mikerr/foo2zjs (foo2zjs, GPL v2 or later).

- ppd/Dell C1660w HBPLv1.ppd
  Derived from "Dell C1760nw HBPLv1.ppd" of the same macOS project. Changed:
  model name and device ID for the C1660w, filter path. The change is noted
  in the file itself.

- tests/testpage.pdf
  From the same macOS project, used unchanged.

